Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:34.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}你在这里不受欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:38.36,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}这里没人想看到你的脸 听到你出声
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:40.57,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}你是觉得自己一直在赢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.57,0:03:42.66,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}但恶魔马上就会来见你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:46.49,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}你知道他为什么想要你的灵魂 对吧
